title: Podcast launch, on the calendar
description: The schedule these edges, durations and the launch date produce — no date is written down.
due: 2026-11-13
tasks:
  - key: plan
    title: Plan the show
    note: Format, audience, cadence, name
    duration: 5
  - key: record
    title: Record the pilot
    needs: [plan]
    duration: 3
  - key: edit
    title: Edit the pilot
    note: Cut, level, add intro and outro
